@startuml
title Join an online class | FR-011 | BR-039–041
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
start
:Learner or Teacher asks to join a booked class;
:Find the booking and its class;
if (Is the person the booked Learner\nor the class Teacher?) then (Yes)
else (No)
 :Refuse access: this class is for its participants only;
 stop
endif
if (Is the booking confirmed?) then (Yes)
else (No)
 :Refuse access: the booking is not confirmed;
 stop
endif
if (Is it within the allowed joining time?) then (Yes)
else (No)
 :Refuse access: the room is not open for this booking;
 stop
endif
note right
 By default, joining opens 15 minutes before class
 and closes at the scheduled end.
end note
:Prepare a private, temporary invitation\nfor this person and this class;
if (Can the invitation be prepared?) then (Yes)
 :Give the person the room link\nand the invitation expiry time;
 :Person can enter the online classroom;
else (No)
 :Record the problem for support;
 :Tell the person room access is temporarily unavailable;
endif
stop
@enduml
